\subsection{Definitions and mathematical statement}
\paragraph{Statement recorded in the supplied source.}
For each positive integer k, does a finite C(k) bound the $L^{1}$ embedding distortion of all finite connected graphs with positive real edge lengths and a tree decomposition having at most k vertices per bag? The constant is independent of graph size and lengths, and embeddings may use an arbitrary real $L^{1}$ target and positive scale.

\subsection{Short English statement}
For each positive integer k, does a finite C(k) bound the $L^{1}$ embedding distortion of all finite connected graphs with positive real edge lengths and a tree decomposition having at most k vertices per bag? The constant is independent of graph size and lengths, and embeddings may use an arbitrary real $L^{1}$ target and positive scale.

\subsection{Sources}
\begin{itemize}
\item[S1] Original question source or mathematical context.
\url{https://arxiv.org/html/2111.07974v1}.
